OL,3,ALegal challenge to Drumcree parade
OL,4,Adecision under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FA legal challenge to the Parades
OL,7,FCommission's decision to allow the
OL,8,FOrange Order to march on the
OL,9,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,10,FPortadown is under way at the High
OL,11,FCourt in Belfast, where a large crowd
OL,12,Fhas gathered outside.
OL,14,FThe commission announced that the
OL,15,Fparade can proceed on Sunday, for the
OL,16,Ffirst time in almost 30 years, with
OL,17,Frestrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
